($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 22273915, $f$a free and easy kind of feeling$f$, ARRAY[$f$stanzas$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$女将军和长公主 - 请君莫笑 | Female General and Eldest Princess - Qǐng Jūn Mò Xiào$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$After a moment, Li Xian sighs, warm and sweet. “Will you sleep beside me?”--Travelling west to Lian City, the princess and her companion rest for a night in the woods.$f$, 4162, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2020-01-19T05:39:18.217+00:00$f$, $f$2020-01-19T05:39:18.241+00:00$f$, $f$2020-01-16T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 22275649, $f$They stay with their silk$f$, ARRAY[$f$BeneaththeBrim$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$女将军和长公主 - 请君莫笑 | Female General and Eldest Princess - Qǐng Jūn Mò Xiào$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$This hot coal between them, Li Xian was glad to stoke it, even under the pretense of containing. All that thin paper of her voice, it was a whole new gameplay, tempering her eager and naive lover.But then, perhaps, it was the same game they had been playing for a long while. A game of push and pull, a game of distance and closeness,A game that ceased to be a game when they both lost control.$f$, 2909, 1, 2, false, 1, false, $f$2020-01-19T05:47:10.771+00:00$f$, $f$2020-01-19T05:47:10.797+00:00$f$, $f$2020-01-16T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 22282804, $f$surpassing$f$, ARRAY[$f$verity$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$女将军和长公主 - 请君莫笑 | Female General and Eldest Princess - Qǐng Jūn Mò Xiào$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$"Ah-Yue." Li Xian freed her mouth to kiss Lin Wanyue's cheek, and then her ear, in just that place where Lin Wanyue's breath on her own had made Li Xian tremble. "You know what it means—to take me as your wife.""I don't know anything!" Lin Wanyue said anxiously.Li Xian kissed Lin Wanyue's throat and stroked her side. "I believe you," she said. "It's only that Ah-yue is such a fast learner, always surpassing my expectations."$f$, 1050, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2020-01-17T00:26:43.764+00:00$f$, $f$2020-01-17T00:26:43.790+00:00$f$, $f$2020-01-16T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
