($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 60273883, $f$Five Times Archie Charmed Daniel's Family$f$, ARRAY[$f$PerfectlySteadfast$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$England Series - K. J. Charles$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Archie attempts to charm Daniel's mother and winds up winning over the rest of his family instead.$f$, 5625, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2025-05-04T14:27:18.152+00:00$f$, $f$2025-05-04T14:27:18.154+00:00$f$, $f$2024-11-02T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 60286945, $f$spectral dance before the dawn$f$, ARRAY[$f$sophiegaladheon$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$England Series - K. J. Charles$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$"I never knew the most arousing sight in the world was a big man reading poetry.  I could have watched you for hours.  I could have gone to my knees for you there and then."
 —Daniel da Silva, in chapter 16 of Think of England by K.J. Charles$f$, 4125, 1, 1, true, 1, false, $f$2025-05-04T14:29:34.995+00:00$f$, $f$2025-05-04T14:29:34.999+00:00$f$, $f$2024-11-03T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 60479848, $f$What We Learn With Pleasure$f$, ARRAY[$f$Shizuku206$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$England Series - K. J. Charles$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“We just want what’s best for you," Sir Maurice said. "And you’re not the only young man to struggle with this aspect of life. There are ways you can learn, and gain confidence in courting, and all that involves.”“I’m afraid I don’t know quite what you mean, sir.”“The Private Bureau offers just such a service for single men. A series of lessons. You’ll be paired with an experienced tutor, who will teach you each skill, help you practice, and when you graduate from the program, you’ll make a very fine husband, attractive to any young lady who may strike your fancy.”“Lessons? Tutor? I really don’t think such things are necessary, sir. I’m not—I just haven’t—I’m waiting for the right woman. I’ve no pressing desire to marry, and I shouldn’t want to take a place from another fellow with a more urgent need.”“Nonsense, Archie. The lessons will do you good. I’m setting my best man on the job. Mr. da Silva. You’ll feel like a different man after completing the course! I’m sure of it.”$f$, 19497, 1, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2025-05-04T14:28:52.705+00:00$f$, $f$2025-05-04T14:28:52.712+00:00$f$, $f$2024-11-27T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
