($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 16622852, $f$Bad, Bad Alphonse Capone (Original)$f$, ARRAY[$f$Blackbeltkitten2$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Night at the Museum (Movies)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Al and the boys practically beg (Though they won’t stoop so far as to say they were actually begging.) to be colored up like everyone else.  Finally one day they get a paint-job, despite McPhee’s ever-present paranoia; Capone and the gang being popular in grey-scale.  Several weeks after they finally get what they want, Al gets in a fight, and doesn’t come out of it well.  Luckily for him Napoleon is compassionate enough to put up with Al’s grating personality to help him.Please read chapter 13, titled "Quick Update!" as it pertains to updates potentially coming to this story!$f$, 15870, 1, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2025-06-17T22:05:42.239+00:00$f$, $f$2025-07-02T18:07:41.914+00:00$f$, $f$2022-02-08T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
