($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 53865643, $f$A Collection of drabbles I've made$f$, ARRAY[$f$Letmebedelusional$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$ダンジョン飯 | Dungeon Meshi | Delicious in Dungeon$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[$f$Laios Touden/Reader$f$, $f$Laios Touden/Original Character(s)$f$]::text[], $f$A collection of Laios x reader and Laios x oc one shots. Many of these are unfinished and will stay that way. If the tags are incorrect in any way, don't hesitate to contact me about it. The tags will update as I post more chapters.$f$, 1143, 1, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2025-07-03T16:51:50.709+00:00$f$, $f$2025-07-03T16:51:50.710+00:00$f$, $f$2024-02-17T05:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, false, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 53932351, $f$Parasitus Tentaculum$f$, ARRAY[$f$grizzlybeartist$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$ダンジョン飯 | Dungeon Meshi | Delicious in Dungeon$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[$f$Laios Touden/Other(s)$f$, $f$Laios Touden/Tentacle Monster$f$]::text[], $f$The scent of damp and dust filled his lungs as he took a deep breath, trying to force himself not to get lost in morbid thoughts. Suddenly, as he passed through yet another creaky old door, he was surprised by a sudden warmth in the air. He halted, lifting his torch higher, pointing it towards the end of the corridor, and couldn’t help a small gasp of excitement.
A writhing mass of multi-coloured tentacles was planted firmly on the walls and ceiling of the narrow passageway, only a slim gap in the middle where he might squeeze through. Specifically, a variety of tentacle monster he’d never seen before.

----

Laios gets (consensually) tentafucked and gets some eggs put in him. Not much more to say about it.$f$, 3151, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2025-07-03T16:51:46.489+00:00$f$, $f$2025-07-03T16:51:46.496+00:00$f$, $f$2024-02-20T05:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, false, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
