($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 56584750, $f$Of Micemen: An Adventurers Guide to the Social Rituals of Wererats and Their Taste$f$, ARRAY[$f$HybiWybi$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$ダンジョン飯 | Dungeon Meshi | Delicious in Dungeon$f$]::text[], $f$M/M$f$, ARRAY[$f$Laios Touden/Reader$f$, $f$Laios Touden/Original Male Character(s)$f$, $f$Canon/OC$f$]::text[], $f$It wasn't easy for the Touden siblings to give up right before meeting the Red Dragon, assuming they'd finally catch a break. But when a small, strange, party stopped them in their tracks, they simply had to listen. Realizing they didn't have the energy or resources for a serious fight with another party or the dragon.

But the small party caught the attention of Laios as the pair were *almost*.. monsters? A wererat AND a werecat were a sight to behold to the young fighter! He was filled with questions and eager for confirmation on everything he had heard about were-beasts! Causing the derailment of the party's work towards a payout. Leading to the departure of Shuro after being turned down in his final love confession, and Namari leaving upon the lack of pay.

Now Laios writes all that he learns as they delve deeper in the dungeon, following the strange pair. Gaining new party members, new recipes, and new feelings along the way.$f$, 3571, 1, NULL, false, -1, false, $f$2025-07-03T16:48:54.271+00:00$f$, $f$2025-07-03T16:48:54.275+00:00$f$, $f$2024-07-04T04:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, false, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
