($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 61396903, $f$Tenderness and Its Consequences on the (In)sane$f$, ARRAY[$f$dddm_nik$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$ダンジョン飯 | Dungeon Meshi | Delicious in Dungeon$f$]::text[], $f$M/M$f$, ARRAY[$f$Laios Touden/Reader$f$, $f$Laios touden/male reader$f$]::text[], $f$For far too long, curiosity has been lingering within Laios' mind. He knew well demi humans were off limits but, how bad could it possibly be?

